<section id="limitations" aria-labelledby="limitations-heading">
  <h2 id="limitations-heading">What does this calculator refuse to decide?</h2>
  <p>
    It estimates quantity only. Depth, compaction, and whether a load will fit a truck stay with
    you or your supplier.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Results are ordering estimates from the formulas on this page. They are not a driveway design, a drainage plan, or a planting specification.</li>
    <li>The allowance is a percent you choose. It is not a measured waste total for a particular job.</li>
    <li>Preset densities are planning figures. A wet load can weigh more. Use the supplier figure when you have one.</li>
    <li>Bag and pallet counts round up. They are not a promise that a yard or a farm will split a unit.</li>
    <li>Prices are material estimates from the numbers you type. Delivery, tax, and labor are separate.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    The <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a> states the same limit for every calculator. Check the
    order with your supplier before you buy.
  </p>
</section>
